1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:04,140
我们要换掉那个
So we're gonna change that one.

2
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:05,120
我回来啦
I'm back.

3
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,520
快让我瞧瞧 快让我瞧瞧
Okay, let me see, let me see, let me see!

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,860
你们得戴上...
You guys are want to, um...

5
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:12,720
我滴神啊
Oh, my god!

6
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:15,000
爱死了
I love it!

7
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:16,620
没事儿了
All clear.

8
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:18,820
好了 所以...
Okay, so--

9
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:21,800
好棒啊 真的好棒啊
So good! It is so good!

10
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,020
过去几个月里
For the last few months,

11
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:26,120
小卡和我合力翻新一座老房子
Cam and I have been redoing a house together

12
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:26,960
我们会进行炒房活动
that we're gonna flip,

13
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,960
不得不说 进展非常顺利
and I have to say, it has been goin' great!

14
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,920
我们是绝佳组合
We make an amazing team.

15
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,940
-是啊 关键就是信任 -绝对的
- Yeah. The key is trust. - Absolutely.

16
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:36,440
关键在于 我让克莱尔以为是她在掌控大局
The key is, I let Claire think she's in charge.

17
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:39,580
我用更大更贵的东西掩藏我真正想要的
I hide what I want in something bigger and more expensive.

18
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,020
当她反对的时候
Then when she rejects that,

19
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:44,240
我们就能"妥协"成我一直想要的东西
we "compromise" on what I wanted all along.

20
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:46,300
我把这称为"特洛伊木马战术"
I call my method "The trojan horse."

21
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:47,220
知道我是怎么领养到莉莉的吗
You know how I got Lily?

22
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:48,640
我跟米奇说要领养三胞胎
I asked Mitchell for triplets.

23
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,260
你一定会爱死我挑的厨房台面砖
You are going to love what I found for the kitchen countertops.

24
00:00:55,213 --> 00:00:56,949
来自意大利卡拉拉市
It's from Carrarra, Itlay.

25
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:59,000
米开朗基罗就是在那里找到大理石
It's where Michelangelo got the marble

26
00:00:59,000 --> 00:00:59,700
雕刻出《大卫》的
to make the "David."

27
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:03,400
难怪大卫穿不起衣服呢
Now we know why the "David" couldn't afford any clothes.

28
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,240
好吧 其实
Okay, well, uh...

29
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:07,320
我还挑了这款
I also found this one.

30
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:09,920
稍微逊色一些 但没那么贵
It's not as nice, but it's less expensive.

31
00:01:10,580 --> 00:01:12,080
这也超预算了 但是
Well, it's still over budget, but...

32
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,040
我觉得就这个吧
I guess it's okay.

33
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:17,740
对了 我们没买到你要的盥洗室设备
By the way, we couldn't get the powder room fixtures you wanted.

34
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:18,480
什么 为什么
What? Why?

35
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:22,760
超预算23% 也就是982美元
Well, they're 23%, or $982, over the budget.

36
00:01:22,770 --> 00:01:24,179
记住 那块地方只占了
Keeping in mind, that space is only

37
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:26,980
1462平方英尺中的12%
12% of 1,462 square feet.

38
00:01:27,097 --> 00:01:28,840
每次我要控制小卡的花销
Whenever I need to rein in Cam's spending,

39
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:32,320
我就运用我的"数据倾销"法
I employ something that I like to call "The number dump."

40
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:36,196
所以 除非你愿意从地板预算中
So... unless you wanna cut 16%,

41
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:39,840
削减16% 也就是1764美元
or $1,764 from somewhere in the flooring budget,

42
00:01:40,125 --> 00:01:42,020
我们就还得削减4%
we've gotta find another 4% overall.

43
00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:43,800
好吧 不 只要漂亮就行了 没关系
Yeah. No, as long as they're pretty, it's fine. It's fine.

44
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:46,644
昨天 我不小心说了个"十一十零五"
Yesterday, I accidentally said "Eleventy-five."

45
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:02,800
大家都知道我对这个项目有多认真
So everybody knows how hard I worked on that project.

46
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:03,420
我是说
I mean--

47
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:08,600
等等 你在干嘛
Hey, wait. What are you doing?

48
00:02:08,660 --> 00:02:10,040
把糖放回罐子里啊
Trying to put the sugar back in the thing.

49
00:02:10,140 --> 00:02:11,140
去拿扫帚扫掉吧
Well, just go get the broom.

50
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,420
给我一美元我就吃
I'll eat it for a dollar.

51
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:14,700
我说为赚钱吃东西该怎么着
What did I say about eating things for money?

52
00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:16,640
要价得高 人们就会以为物有所值
Charge the most. Then people will think you're worth it.

53
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,369
没错 那至少得5美元
That's right. That's at least $5.

54
00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:20,080
-他说的是一美元 -拿扫帚去
- Hey, he said a dollar. - Broom.

55
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:22,680
老爸 我找不到我的围巾了
Hey, dad, I can't find my scarf,

56
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,713
衣柜的灯也坏了
and the closet light's burnt out.

57
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:25,820
-那就换灯泡啊 -我够不着
- So just change it. - I can't reach it.

58
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:28,140
要是有什么魔法
Oh, if only there was some magical way

59
00:02:28,140 --> 00:02:30,100
能让人接近天花板就好了
of getting up closer to the ceiling.

60
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:32,000
你刚刚说话的语气很像迪兰
Okay, now you just sound like Dylan.

61
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,560
我说的是梯子啦
I'm saying get a step stool.

62
00:02:34,180 --> 00:02:35,800
一件一件来 好吗
One thing at a time, okay?

63
00:02:35,820 --> 00:02:36,940
什么情况
What is happening?

64
00:02:37,540 --> 00:02:38,260
我在扫地啊
I'm sweeping.

65
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:39,520
不 你这不是扫地
No, you're not sweeping.

66
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,820
而是把糖都扫分散了
You're just spreading it all around.

67
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
现在要我吃的话 收费得提高了
It's gonna cost more if you want me to eat it now.

68
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:44,980
那一刻我突然发现
That's when it hit me--

69
00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:47,880
我的女儿们完全不会做家务
My daughters know nothing about home care and maintenance.

70
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:49,560
我不希望她们这么依赖
I don't want 'em to be dependent.

71
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,460
我该向她们展示一位自强自立的
It's up to me to show them what a modern,

72
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:53,960
现代女性该是什么样了
self-sufficient woman looks like.

73
00:02:57,980 --> 00:02:59,140
小心点 继续这样下去
Careful. Keep that up,

74
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:01,240
他要打电话给车管局时 就会按"兔"键
he'll have to hit "Numero dos" when he calls the DMV.

75
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,960
等到他会打电话的时候
By the time, he's old enough to call,

76
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,900
会按数字键"万"
tt will be "Numero uno."

77
00:03:05,751 --> 00:03:06,809
太好了 他来了
Ay, there he is.

78
00:03:06,809 --> 00:03:09,372
曼尼 你为什么自己跑到外面去吃早餐
Manny, why did you have breakfast alone outside?

79
00:03:09,372 --> 00:03:11,260
我喜欢吃露天早餐
I felt like eating breakfast alfresco.

80
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:12,500
意思是说他把裤子都脱了吗
Does that mean he had his pants off?

81
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,920
因为如果我不行 他也不行
Because if I can't, he can't.

82
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:17,720
杰 他这一整个星期都自己在外面吃饭
Jay, he's been eating outside on his own all week.

83
00:03:17,940 --> 00:03:19,820
你觉得是不是因为我把注意力
Do you think that he feels left out

84
00:03:19,820 --> 00:03:21,680
都集中到乔身上 他感觉受冷落了
because of all the attention I give Joe?

85
00:03:21,820 --> 00:03:23,140
我也在想同样的事
You know, I've been wondering the same thing.

86
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:25,480
跟你说 不如今天下午就让我带乔
Tell you what--why don't I have some father-son time

87
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:26,660
享受父子时光
with Joe this afternoon

88
00:03:26,670 --> 00:03:28,505
你去陪陪曼尼
and give you some time with Manny?

89
00:03:28,906 --> 00:03:30,240
好啊 你真贴心
Ay, that's so sweet.

90
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:32,180
你可以带乔去上宝宝班
You can take Joe to his baby class.

91
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,960
歌洛莉亚 我觉得他知道该怎么做宝宝
Gloria, I think he already knows how to be a baby.

92
00:03:34,020 --> 00:03:36,200
我爱你 但你这话我可笑不出来了
I love you, but I can't laugh at that again.

93
00:03:36,715 --> 00:03:40,080
曼尼 你放学后我去接你
Manny, how about I pick you up after school,

94
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,960
我们享受一下母子专属时光怎么样
and we both have a special day?

95
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:43,200
我之前跟杰说过
Well, I did talk to Jay

96
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,620
要买票参加一个读书会的事儿
about getting some tickets for this reading.

97
00:03:45,180 --> 00:03:45,740
什么读书会
What reading?

98
00:03:46,260 --> 00:03:46,660
不是吧你
Seriously?

99
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,320
《大白鲸》的读书会啊
The stage reading of "Moby Dick"?

100
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,720
我昨天晚上跟你说的
I told you about it last night.

101
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:52,140
我完全记不起来了
I have zero recollection of this.

102
00:03:52,340 --> 00:03:54,100
我就知道我不该给你倒第二杯威士忌
I knew I shouldn't have poured you that second Scotch.

103
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,580
抱歉 伙计 但我已经决定
Sorry, buddy, but I already committed

104
00:03:55,580 --> 00:03:56,720
今天下午陪乔了
to spending the afternoon with Joe

105
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,360
好让你妈妈能多点时间陪陪你
so you and your mom could have more time together.

106
00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,700
也许她能带你去
Hey, maybe she can take you.

107
00:03:59,700 --> 00:04:01,280
-可以吗 老妈 -当然了 亲爱的
- Can we, mom? - Of course, mi amor.

108
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,600
今天是你的专属日 你想做什么都行
It's your special day. We'll do whatever you want.

109
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:06,360
太好了 这将成为你永生难忘的4小时
Great. This is gonna be four hours you'll never forget.

110
00:04:06,940 --> 00:04:09,560
伙计 看来只剩我们"兔"了
Hey, buddy. Looks like it's just the dos of us.

111
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:13,980
我怎么觉得你好像暗中捣鬼了
Why do I feel that you did something shifty?

112
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:14,840
我毫不知情
I have no idea.

113
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,787
但说真的 这可不是你的优良品质
But I gotta say, it's not your best quality.

114
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,460
好了 亲爱的 祝你今天开心
All right, sweetie, you have a good day.

115
00:04:20,988 --> 00:04:22,580
爸爸 看我玩手球吧
Watch me play handball, daddy.

116
00:04:22,580 --> 00:04:23,300
好的
Oh, okay.

117
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:23,940
下一个
Next!

118
00:04:24,740 --> 00:04:26,760
那是麦洛 他打败了所有人
That's Milo. He beats everybody.

119
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,360
下一个手下败将
Next loser!

120
00:04:30,070 --> 00:04:32,498
-他真刻薄 -我看出来了
- He's mean. - Yeah, I'm gettin' that.

121
00:04:34,618 --> 00:04:36,632
-下一个 -到你了
- Next! - That's you.

122
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:38,540
又是个女的
Another girl?

123
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,440
亲爱的 亲爱的
Hey, sweetie? Sweetie?

124
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:42,034
你一定会很棒的
You're gonna do great, okay?

125
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:43,580
你说是就是呗
If you say so.

126
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:44,780
下一个
Next!

127
00:04:44,780 --> 00:04:46,840
麦洛 这是我的错
Uh, Milo? That-- that was my fault.

128
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:47,780
我分散了她的注意力
I distracted her,

129
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:48,840
所以或许可以让她再来一次
So maybe she could just go again?

130
00:04:48,900 --> 00:04:50,580
不带重玩的 下一个
No do-overs. Next!

131
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:53,540
下一个是我 我把这个机会给她了
Well, I'm next, and I would like to give her my turn.

132
00:04:53,540 --> 00:04:55,940
不许换人 你到底玩不玩
No switcheroos. Are you playing or not?

133
00:04:55,940 --> 00:04:58,340
-不玩 -胆小鬼 下一个
- No. - Chicken. Next.

134
00:04:58,900 --> 00:05:01,040
我痛恨恶霸 我恨他们一辈子
I hate bullies. I've hated them my whole life.

135
00:05:01,180 --> 00:05:03,040
我从斯科特·杜肯 格雷戈·普奇科
I hated them when they were named Scott Dworkin

136
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:06,080
到凯蒂·格林伍德 全都恨
Or Greg Pechenko or Katie Greenwald.

137
00:05:07,778 --> 00:05:09,818
你猜怎么着 我决定上阵
Okay, you know what? I'm gonna play.

138
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:11,420
可是 爸爸 他很厉害的
But, daddy, he's really good.

139
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:12,400
我也很厉害的
Well, I'm really good, too.

140
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:14,460
-可这是体育运动 -我可以的
- But it's a sport. - I got this.

141
00:05:14,460 --> 00:05:15,220
你们唠完没
You done talking?

142
00:05:15,421 --> 00:05:17,340
我们现在在学校较量最合适不过了
You know, it's really appropriate that we're at a school,

143
00:05:17,340 --> 00:05:20,080
因为我要给你上上课[教训]
because I'm about to teach you a lesson.

144
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:23,520
下一个
Next!

145
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,600
好吧 对不起 亲爱的
All right. Sorry, sweetheart.

146
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:27,020
我送你去上课
Here, I'll walk you to class.

147
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:28,960
不用了 谢谢你 先生
No, thank you, mister.

148
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:30,016
但是
But...

149
00:05:35,497 --> 00:05:36,532
你在干嘛
Whatcha doin'?

150
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:39,280
我觉得我有个想法
I think I have an idea.

151
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:47,580
每座房子都需要让人惊叹的"哇"元素 对不对
Okay. Every house needs a "Wow" factor, right?

152
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:50,420
这座院子缺少的是什么
What is the one thing this backyard is missing?

153
00:05:50,431 --> 00:05:52,720
-一名够格的买家吗 -别说傻话
- A qualified buyer? - Now don't be silly.

154
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:55,760
不是的 应该是一个带火焰效果的水景
No. A water feature with a fire element.

155
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:56,960
天呐 不行
Oh, god, no.

156
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:58,760
拜托 只要设想一下
No, no, please. Now just imagine--

157
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:00,560
后边这一整面墙
This entire back wall

158
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:04,080
都被连接到蓄水池上 每隔15分钟就
cascading into a reservoir that erupts into flames

159
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:06,000
像火焰一样喷发出来 听起来怎么样
on the quarter hour. How does that sound?

160
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,780
听起来挺费钱
Like we need a white tiger.

161
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,420
也许我的野心太大了
Maybe I'm being a little ambitious.

162
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,460
那我们只做一对舞蹈喷泉好了
So let's just do a couple dancing water fountains,

163
00:06:11,740 --> 00:06:13,340
-收工吧 -不 等一下 小卡
- call it a day. - No, wait. Cam, Cam, Cam.

164
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,020
那样也会让我们的景观预算
That's gonna still put us, like,

165
00:06:15,020 --> 00:06:16,523
超出将近3500美元
$3,500 over our landscape budget.

166
00:06:16,523 --> 00:06:18,480
现在比我之前预想的超了40-12%了
Right now, we're 40-12 percent higher than I thought

167
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:21,060
因为斯密特加上了8%的附加费
we'd be at this point because Smitty added that 8% surcharge.

168
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:23,211
不好意思 你刚才是说40-12%吗
I'm sorry--did you just say 40-12 percent?

169
00:06:23,313 --> 00:06:24,020
没 我没说
Mm, no, I didn't.

170
00:06:24,020 --> 00:06:25,540
你说了 你总是这样
Yes, you did. You do this all the time.

171
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:28,380
你总是拿数字砸我 吓唬我 糊弄我
You just throw numbers at me to frighten and confuse me.

172
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,600
我还一直以为我们合作得挺好
And here I thought we were working so well together,

173
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,960
原来你一直在暗中操纵
and you're just being manipulative.

174
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,280
那你呢 小卡
What about you, Cam?

175
00:06:33,380 --> 00:06:35,160
故意挑那些昂贵不切实际的东西
Pitching these crazy, over-the-top ideas

176
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,260
那样你就能得到你真正想要的
just so you can slip in what you really want.

177
00:06:37,260 --> 00:06:40,280
你竟然指责我对你实行特洛伊木马战术
Oh, how dare you accuse me of trojan horsing you.

178
00:06:40,460 --> 00:06:41,940
你这招竟然还起名了
You have a name for it?

179
00:06:41,980 --> 00:06:42,640
不是 我是说
No, I mean--

180
00:06:43,180 --> 00:06:44,620
你知道吗 我才不要站在这里
You know what? I will not stand here

181
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:46,180
被你这样的人指责
and be accused by the likes of you.

182
00:06:46,220 --> 00:06:47,780
如果这里有扇门 大小姐
And if there was a door here, missy,

183
00:06:47,780 --> 00:06:49,000
我非当你面摔门不可
I would slam it in your face.

184
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:52,220
我还以为要等15分钟才会"发火"呢
I thought we weren't flaming till the quarter hour!

185
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,780
歌洛莉亚和曼尼把我和乔单独留在家里
Gloria and Manny left me alone with Joe,

186
00:06:57,780 --> 00:07:00,100
那非常爽 但也就爽了20分钟左右
and it was great... for about 20 minutes.

187
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:02,760
然后这小家伙就开始折磨我了
then the little bugger turned on me.

188
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,480
我使劲浑身解数让他安静下来
I tried everything to calm him down--

189
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:06,100
轻摇他 拿奶瓶喂他
Bouncing. Bottle.

190
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:07,880
用亮色的东西逗他
Brightly colored objects.

191
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,420
用大瓶酒灌自己
Bigger bottle.

192
00:07:10,060 --> 00:07:11,920
所以我决定采取"把他扔车里"的老招数
So I did the old "put him in the car" trick.

193
00:07:11,940 --> 00:07:13,400
不过我还是能听到他在外面哭
But I could still hear him out there.

194
00:07:13,460 --> 00:07:14,140
我是在开玩笑啦
I'm just kidding.

195
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,140
我带他去上课
I drove him to his little class,

196
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:18,140
不过我们还没到那里 他就睡着了
but he dozed off right before we got there.

197
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:20,940
或许他暗中偷学了杰·普里契特的妙招
Or he took a page from the Jay Pritchett playbook--

198
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:24,560
看到即将面对的悲惨处境 就假装睡着了
saw the crap he was in for and pretended to be asleep.

199
00:07:25,620 --> 00:07:26,320
普里契特先生
Mr. Pritchett?

200
00:07:26,900 --> 00:07:28,320
-是我 -我是瑞秋·莉兹
- Yeah. - Rachel Lissy.

201
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:30,220
克莱尔的高中同学 记得吗
Claire's friend from high school, remember?

202
00:07:30,300 --> 00:07:31,140
我怎么可能忘呢
How could I forget?

203
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:33,480
你开着你那台小车把我家信箱撞倒了
You knocked down my mailbox with your k-car.

204
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,180
我再次道歉
Again, I apologize.

205
00:07:35,180 --> 00:07:36,900
-你过得怎样 -好得不能再好了
- How you doin'? - Couldn't be better.

206
00:07:36,900 --> 00:07:38,760
我都结婚15年了
I've been married for 15 years,

207
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:40,140
那两个大男孩是我儿子
Two great boys over there.

208
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:43,040
库珀 放开你弟弟
Cooper! Unhand your brother!

209
00:07:45,220 --> 00:07:47,200
我正要带他们去看詹姆斯·邦德电影
I'm taking them to the James Bond movie,

210
00:07:47,260 --> 00:07:50,040
他们不让我坐在他们旁边
and they don't want me to sit with them.

211
00:07:51,020 --> 00:07:52,160
我真怀念小婴儿
I miss babies.

212
00:07:52,171 --> 00:07:53,460
婴儿好玩多了
Oh, they're a lot of fun, huh?

213
00:07:53,460 --> 00:07:55,680
-见到你真高兴 -见到你才叫高兴呢
- So nice to see you. - Nice seeing you.

214
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:57,260
挺好的孩子
Great kids.

215
00:07:59,778 --> 00:08:01,032
不 不行
Ugh! No, you're not!

216
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:04,980
乔 我找了个更好的方式增进父子感情
Joe, I found a better way for us to bond...

217
00:08:06,780 --> 00:08:07,420
詹姆斯·邦德[意译：增进感情]
James Bond.

218
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:12,900
我爸爸教会了我一切关于保修房子的事情
My dad taught me everything there is to know about maintaining a home,

219
00:08:12,900 --> 00:08:14,960
今天 这一传统要传承下去
and today, that tradition continues.

220
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:17,600
瞧 灯泡换好了
Voila! Light bulb changed.

221
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:20,560
我有个想法
Hey, I have an idea.

222
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:22,900
我们一起了解下这幢房子
Let's get to know the house, huh?

223
00:08:23,180 --> 00:08:24,220
我有个想法
Hey, I have an idea--

224
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,220
我们把他锁在里面吧
Let's lock him in.

225
00:08:25,970 --> 00:08:29,005
快到这个宝贝东西这里来
Okay. Let's go over this baby right here.

226
00:08:29,005 --> 00:08:30,552
我们看到的是什么
What are we lookin' at, huh?

227
00:08:30,740 --> 00:08:31,300
光合作用
Photosynthesis?

228
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,300
某种意义上来说 是的
In a sense, yeah.

229
00:08:36,300 --> 00:08:37,352
-是吗 -是的
- Yeah? - Yeah, yeah.

230
00:08:37,372 --> 00:08:40,100
光合作用将二氧化碳
Uh, photosynthesis converts carbon dioxide

231
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:41,460
转化为植物的营养物质
into food for plants.

232
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:45,240
热水器将冷水转化成热水
This water heater converts cold water into hot.

233
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:47,400
什么东西能将我们的对话转成结束状态
What converts this conversation into over?

234
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,900
姑娘们 你们得学会这些东西
Girls, you need to learn these things.

235
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,840
终有一天你们会独自生活
You might find yourselves living alone at some point.

236
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:54,940
我期盼那一天的到来
I long for the day.

237
00:08:54,940 --> 00:08:57,420
我们从一些最基础的开始 好吗
Okay, we're just gonna start with something really basic, all right?

238
00:08:57,420 --> 00:08:59,860
我把指示灯给关了
I am turning the pilot light off.

239
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,220
这玩意儿偶尔会熄灭
These things go out occasionally.

240
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:03,220
-为什么 -我不知道 没有人知道
- Why? - I don't know. No one knows.

241
00:09:03,260 --> 00:09:04,560
就当是小精灵干的好了
Let's just say gremlins do it.

242
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,940
如果这事发生在你们身上 怎么办
But if it happens to you, what do you do?

243
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,180
-叫个伙计来 -或妹子
- Call a guy. - Or a girl.

244
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,800
天啊 我们真的是在柜子里了[同性恋]
Oh, my god, we're literally in a closet,

245
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:11,000
-你还那么说 -集中注意力
- and you just said that. - Focus.

246
00:09:11,068 --> 00:09:14,075
你们不需要叫任何人 重新点亮它
You don't call anyone. To re-light the pilot,

247
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,240
把阀转到"控制"
Turn the valve to "Pilot,"

248
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,740
按下去 让气流通
You press it down to begin the flow of gas,

249
00:09:17,751 --> 00:09:19,404
等上那么几秒
You wait a few seconds...

250
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,440
你们是从哪个世界来的啊
Where you guys from originally?

251
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,800
按下点火器
And you just press the igniter.

252
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:25,920
好了
There you go.

253
00:09:26,510 --> 00:09:28,880
真是奇怪 怎么不管用了
That's odd. Why is it not working?

254
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:30,160
我知道了
Oh, I got it.

255
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:32,360
我们何不直接从水龙头里接热水灌进去呢
Why don't we just fill it up with hot water from the tap?

256
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:35,440
又灭了一盏灯[蠢死]
Found another light that's out.

257
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,840
克莱尔和我在水景这事上陷入了僵局
Claire and I were at a stalemate on the water feature.

258
00:09:38,900 --> 00:09:41,580
所以我请了一位有经验的专家过来
So I brought in an experienced professional

259
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:43,240
打破这种窘境
to help break the tie.

260
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:45,340
帕姆恰好是我的朋友
Pam also happens to be a friend

261
00:09:45,340 --> 00:09:47,720
也是莉莉学校的同性恋家长
and a fellow gay parent at Lily's school.

262
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:50,900
我是想在背后做手脚 搞定克莱尔吗
Am I trying to stack the deck against Claire here?

263
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:54,280
不 我绝不会这么
No. I would never be so...

264
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,240
天才
genius.

265
00:09:59,843 --> 00:10:01,630
克莱尔 这是帕姆
Oh. Oh, Claire, this is Pam.

266
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:03,480
-帕姆 这是克莱尔 -很高兴见到你
- Pam, Claire. - Oh, hi. Nice to meet you.

267
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:06,140
-你好 -帕姆是有执照的承包商
- You, too. - Pam is a licensed contractor.

268
00:10:06,140 --> 00:10:06,900
装修过很多房子
Done a lot of houses.

269
00:10:07,540 --> 00:10:09,240
我觉得有第三方在这里挺好的
I thought it'd be nice to bring in a third party

270
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:11,380
会比较客观 帮忙解决喷泉纠纷
that's objective, to help settle the fountain dispute.

271
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:13,880
要客观 是啊
Oh. Objective, right.

272
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:15,620
我儿子和莉莉是同学
Well, my son does go to school with Lily,

273
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:17,720
但是相信我 这绝不会比你的美貌
but believe me, that is not gonna sway my decision

274
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:19,580
更影响我的决定
any more than the fact that you are beautiful.

275
00:10:20,540 --> 00:10:22,460
谢谢 你也很美貌
Thank you. You are, too.

276
00:10:22,460 --> 00:10:23,160
谢谢
Thank you.

277
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:24,960
我来帮你拿"罐子"[胸部]
Let me grab your cans.

278
00:10:25,260 --> 00:10:26,000
你的油漆罐
Your paint cans.

279
00:10:26,800 --> 00:10:28,020
好了
There you go.

280
00:10:28,020 --> 00:10:29,075
那么
So...

281
00:10:35,540 --> 00:10:36,701
怎么了呀 乔
Hey, what's the matter,Joe?

282
00:10:36,701 --> 00:10:39,419
嘿 好小子 乖小子
Hey, that's a boy. That's a boy.

283
00:10:40,167 --> 00:10:42,489
到这里来 来
Come here. There you go.

284
00:10:42,639 --> 00:10:44,512
好了 好了
Here you are. There you go.

285
00:10:44,521 --> 00:10:45,568
好了
There you go.

286
00:10:46,500 --> 00:10:51,520
我很乐意带他出去 哄他不哭
You know, I'm happy to take him outside until he stops crying.

287
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:52,589
不不 我不希望你错过这电影
Oh, no, I wouldn't want you to miss this.

288
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:54,840
没关系 丹尼尔·克雷格不露肉
It's fine. Once Daniel Craig put his shirt back on,

289
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,060
-我就没兴趣了 -真的吗
- I lost interest. - Are you sure?

290
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,260
-真的 -好吧
- Absolutely. - Okay.

291
00:10:57,494 --> 00:10:59,461
给 去吧 好小子
Here--just go ahead. Attaboy.

292
00:10:59,844 --> 00:11:01,704
乖小子 谢谢你了
Attaboy. Thank you very much.

293
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:03,000
我就在外面
I'll be right outside.

294
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,808
-好的 -嘘
- Okay. - Shh!

295
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:05,440
你闭嘴 内森
You shush, Nathan!

296
00:11:08,772 --> 00:11:10,080
笨东西
Stupid thing!

297
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,640
爸 我们站这好久了
Dad, we've been standing here forever.

298
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:12,800
就不能直接叫个伙计来修吗
Can't we just call the guy?

299
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,660
不 没什么伙计 我就是那个伙计
No. There is no guy. I'm the guy.

300
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:16,600
这是我需要你做的 跑去五金店
Here's what I need you to do. Run to the hardware store,

301
00:11:16,620 --> 00:11:18,800
买个T6梅花螺丝刀回来
get me a T6 torx screwdriver.

302
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:20,240
-什么 -就问那伙计
- What? - Just ask the guy.

303
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,420
我以为那没有什么伙计
I thought there was no guy.

304
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,360
那有一个
There is one there!

305
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,380
-也有可能是妹子啊 -喏
- Could be a girl. - Eh?

306
00:11:23,380 --> 00:11:24,460
快去
Just go!

307
00:11:25,540 --> 00:11:27,280
我不需要梅花螺丝刀
I didn't need a torx screwdriver.

308
00:11:27,540 --> 00:11:28,840
不过我一直都想要一个
I've always wanted one, though.

309
00:11:29,620 --> 00:11:31,400
但我需要他们出去
But I needed them out of the house,

310
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:34,080
那么 我就可以 找个伙计
so... I could... call... a guy.

311
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:36,700
老爸 帮帮我
Dad, help me.

312
00:11:36,935 --> 00:11:38,440
我们是又要看你在那儿
Are we gonna do that thing again

313
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:40,780
像《风月俏佳人》里一样试穿各种衣服吗
where you try on different outfits like in "Pretty Woman"?

314
00:11:44,193 --> 00:11:46,548
我刚看见你很帅地投篮嘛 是吧
Saw you sinkin' some j's back there, huh?

315
00:11:46,548 --> 00:11:48,831
1盯4联防 掩护俩人
Box and one. Cover two.

316
00:11:48,914 --> 00:11:50,999
砍鲨战术 对不对
Sh-shaq-a-hack? Am I right?

317
00:11:51,020 --> 00:11:51,920
根本不沾边
Not even close.

318
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:53,863
-什么事 -据江湖传闻
- What's up? - Well, word has it

319
00:11:53,863 --> 00:11:56,240
你曾是一名优秀的手球运动员
that you were a pretty good handball player back in the day.

320
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:56,640
是啊
Yeah.

321
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:59,300
尼尔·阿姆斯特朗还曾是"优秀"喇叭手呢
And Neil Armstrong was a "pretty good" trumpet player.

322
00:11:59,500 --> 00:12:01,040
我发现你在操场上待的时间
I see you spent a lot more time on the court

323
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:02,000
远比在教室长
than you did in the classroom,

324
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,540
所以很明显 我找对人了
So clearly, I've come to the right place.

325
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:05,420
听着 我需要你传授我你全部的球技
Look, I need you to teach me everything you know.

326
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:06,640
为什么这事那么重要
How come it's so important?

327
00:12:06,780 --> 00:12:07,580
有个小孩
Well, there's this kid,

328
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:10,160
他欺负莉莉和她的同学
and he's been kind of bullying Lily and all her friends.

329
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:11,400
我试图教训他
And I tried to teach him.

330
00:12:11,460 --> 00:12:13,480
想让他在手球场上安分点
I tried to put him in his place on the handball court,

331
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:14,780
结果失败了
and I lost.

332
00:12:14,780 --> 00:12:17,900
我脑子里都是莉莉失望的眼神
And I-I could just see the disappointment in Lily's eyes.

333
00:12:17,940 --> 00:12:19,680
说得好像她眼睛里有感情一样
Like there's any emotion in those eyes.

334
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:21,188
你要不要帮我
Are you gonna help me or not?

335
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:22,920
-好吧 -太棒了
- Okay. - Yes!

336
00:12:23,100 --> 00:12:24,880
但我要你付出105%的努力
But I need you to give it 105%.

337
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:27,560
不 我付出110%的努力 哥们儿
Ah, no. It's 110%, buddy.

338
00:12:27,660 --> 00:12:28,500
那不可能
That's impossible.

339
00:12:28,989 --> 00:12:31,600
是的 喷泉是有些昂贵
Yes. I think the fountain's a little pricy.

340
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,560
但是 它的重要性简直无法忽视
But you know what? It's gonna more than make up for itself

341
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:34,560
因为当一家人走进房子
when a family comes in here

342
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:37,360
将被这个家迷得神魂颠倒
and falls head over heels in love with this home.

343
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:38,860
好吧 这点说得好
Okay, that's a valid point.

344
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:40,620
外面确实还有点儿空间
It is a bit of an empty space out there.

345
00:12:40,820 --> 00:12:41,220
谢谢
Thank you.

346
00:12:41,220 --> 00:12:42,860
好吧 我知道你的意思
Well, I mean, I see what you're saying.

347
00:12:42,860 --> 00:12:44,960
不好意思 这里面真热啊
Sorry. It's hot in here, right?

348
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:47,720
女人到了一定年纪就会出现你这情况
Oh, well, you know, that happens to women of a certain age,

349
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:48,700
我妈就是
Like with my mom.

350
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:51,680
不会吧 你才多少岁啊 35岁吧
Are you kidding? What are you, like, 35?

351
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:54,080
你也美丽动人啊 像个天使一样
What are you, like, an angel sent from heaven?

352
00:12:54,880 --> 00:12:56,560
我知道你的意思
I see what you're saying.

353
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:59,700
我觉得这样价格太高 就没人会买了
I just feel that we might be pricing ourselves out of the market.

354
00:12:59,700 --> 00:13:01,680
要是有户人家来了
If a family wants to come in here,

355
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:04,060
还想建一个喷泉
and--and build themselves a fountain,

356
00:13:04,060 --> 00:13:05,740
他们可以自己建啊
They can do so themselves.

357
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:06,980
确实啊
That's true.

358
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:09,700
好吧 帕姆 你知道的
Um, okay, well, you know, Pam,

359
00:13:09,859 --> 00:13:13,080
有很多像我们这样的家庭
Um, there are lots of families like...ours...

360
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:15,880
他们搬过来 是因为这里的学校好
Moving to this neighborhood for the schools.

361
00:13:15,891 --> 00:13:19,624
插一句 我看过康纳的艺术作品 太美了
P.S., saw Connor's art project--gorgeous.

362
00:13:19,740 --> 00:13:21,240
不愧是才艺世家啊
Talent runs in the family.

363
00:13:23,100 --> 00:13:26,540
总之 我觉得 如果后院做得有趣点儿
Anyway, I'm just saying I think a family would respond

364
00:13:26,540 --> 00:13:28,820
一定会打动人家
to having a little drama in the backyard.

365
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:33,080
我看帕姆已经把意见说得很清楚了 对吧
I think Pam's made it pretty clear what she likes. Am I right?

366
00:13:34,900 --> 00:13:36,220
糟了
Oh, no.

367
00:13:36,220 --> 00:13:38,940
我的衣服都是通透的了
Now my shirt is all see-through.

368
00:13:38,940 --> 00:13:40,260
你的花招也被看透了
And so are you.

369
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:42,240
你不会被这种"美人计"给迷住了吧
Please tell me you are not falling for this.

370
00:13:42,900 --> 00:13:46,060
不会 但我看得非常过瘾
I'm not, but I am enjoying this little show tremendously,

371
00:13:46,060 --> 00:13:47,000
所以谢谢啦
So thank you.

372
00:13:48,280 --> 00:13:50,960
话说回来 我从专业角度对喷泉的意见是
As for my professional opinion on the fountain,

373
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:51,960
别做了
don't do it.

374
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:54,200
如果是你们自己住的
I mean, if you were gonna live here yourself,

375
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:57,180
那我会赞同 但那东西太贵了
I'd say go for it. But it's too expensive for a flip.

376
00:13:57,340 --> 00:13:58,520
就是呀 就是呀
Yeah. Yeah.

377
00:13:58,860 --> 00:14:00,080
谢谢
Thank you.

378
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,360
-小卡 -好吧
- Cam? - Fine.

379
00:14:03,140 --> 00:14:03,280
该死的拉拉
Lesbians.

380
00:14:05,540 --> 00:14:08,700
我不敢相信我竟然陪亲儿子一起买吊袜带了
I can't believe I just went garter shopping with my son.

381
00:14:08,820 --> 00:14:10,640
如果你有更好的办法让袜子不往下掉
When you find a better way to keep my socks up,

382
00:14:10,640 --> 00:14:11,260
告诉我一声
let me know.

383
00:14:11,900 --> 00:14:13,200
既然我们都来商城了
Hey, as long as we're in the mall,

384
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:15,345
要不去婴儿乐园看看杰和乔吧
you wanna stop in the baby class to see Jay and Joe?

385
00:14:15,345 --> 00:14:17,340
别了 让他俩好好培养感情吧
No. They need this time to make a connection.

386
00:14:17,340 --> 00:14:18,520
父子关系可不像母子关系
It's not like mother and son,

387
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:20,720
不是生来就那么强烈的
that the bond is naturally strong.

388
00:14:20,940 --> 00:14:22,620
嘿 那不是乔吗
Hey, isn't that Joe over there?

389
00:14:24,414 --> 00:14:26,528
不 那是别家的小屁孩
No, that's some weird baby.

390
00:14:27,002 --> 00:14:28,920
他才没我家乔那么完美呢
He's not perfect like my little Joe.

391
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:30,160
但他的毯子一模一样呢
But he's got the same blanket.

392
00:14:36,026 --> 00:14:37,991
歌洛莉亚 你在这儿干嘛
Gloria. What are you doing here?

393
00:14:38,660 --> 00:14:40,440
你怎么能把宝宝交给陌生人
You gave our baby to a stranger?!

394
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:42,333
她不是陌生人 她是克莱尔的朋友
She's not a stranger. She's Claire's friend.

395
00:14:42,333 --> 00:14:43,658
-嘘 -闭嘴 内森
- Shh! - Shut up, Nathan!

396
00:14:43,913 --> 00:14:44,913
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

397
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:50,060
爸 煤气开了
The gas is on, dad.

398
00:14:50,060 --> 00:14:51,400
点火器有火花了
I can see the spark from the igniter.

399
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:52,260
我不知道那是什么玩意儿
I don't know what it is.

400
00:14:52,380 --> 00:14:53,660
那是热电偶
That's your thermocouple.

401
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:55,940
里面积了沉淀物
You get a little sediment in there

402
00:14:55,940 --> 00:14:57,460
或者是铁锈 就不好用了
or some rust, and you're done for.

403
00:14:57,560 --> 00:14:58,980
原来是热电偶的问题啊
The thermocouple. Of course.

404
00:14:58,980 --> 00:15:00,140
我怎么没想到
Why didn't I think of that?

405
00:15:00,140 --> 00:15:02,733
谢啦 爸 这点小事不该打扰你的
Thanks, dad. I-I shouldn't be buggin' you with this stuff.

406
00:15:02,733 --> 00:15:04,636
你开什么玩笑 我最乐于助人了
Are you kiddin' me? I love to help.

407
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:06,300
让我觉得你还需要我
Makes me feel like you still need me.

408
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:07,420
我当然需要你
Of course I need you.

409
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:09,040
你总是这些问题的专家
You're the best when it comes to this.

410
00:15:09,051 --> 00:15:10,500
还有什么要修的吗
Anything else you need fixin'?

411
00:15:10,500 --> 00:15:11,440
有啊 事实上
Yeah, actually,

412
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:13,766
我的大拇指坏了
I've been havin' a little trouble with my thumb.

413
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:16,380
老伙计啦 那个好修
Oh, the old thumb. That's simple.

414
00:15:16,580 --> 00:15:19,660
只要把它摁回去 然后"啵"一声就好了
Just push it back in and make that popping sound.

415
00:15:21,052 --> 00:15:23,150
-好啦 你这办法好 -修好啦
- Oh, yeah, you're right. - There you go.

416
00:15:25,300 --> 00:15:27,640
今晚记得对克莱尔说她很美
Make sure you tell Claire how pretty she looks tonight.

417
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:29,060
女人就爱听这个
A woman needs to hear that.

418
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:30,320
你也要对妈说说
You do the same with mom.

419
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,880
别了 你妈妈厌烦了
No, your mom's a little tired of

420
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:33,320
我经常对她说克莱尔很美
hearing how pretty Claire is.

421
00:15:34,180 --> 00:15:35,060
说得好
Good one!

422
00:15:35,980 --> 00:15:36,960
好吧 爱你哦
All right. Love you.

423
00:15:37,220 --> 00:15:38,060
我也爱你哦
Love you, too.

424
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:40,040
爸 我们回来啦
Dad, we're home.

425
00:15:41,780 --> 00:15:45,040
这真是最无聊的一次购物
That was the least fun I have ever had shopping ever.

426
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:45,620
给你
Here.

427
00:15:46,625 --> 00:15:50,220
宝贝 这是扭力扳手 不是十字螺丝刀
Honey, that's a torque wrench, not a torx screwdriver.

428
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:51,840
好吧 你就嚷嚷吧
Okay, you're just screaming now.

429
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:54,240
你不能自己去买吗 你可是行家啊
Can't you just go get it? You're the best at this stuff.

430
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:56,340
就是啊 还有 车子也有点儿问题
Yeah, plus the car is doing something funny,

431
00:15:56,340 --> 00:15:57,440
而且仪表盘上有个
and there's a light on the dashboard

432
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:58,780
像小油灯一样的指示灯亮了
that looks like a little genie lamp.

433
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:01,480
我家孩子不能自立 但也许那没关系
My kids are helpless, but maybe that's okay.

434
00:16:01,940 --> 00:16:03,920
因为多年以后 等他们有了自己的房子
Because years from now when they have their own houses,

435
00:16:03,920 --> 00:16:05,460
他们会用超炫的高科技视频电话打给我
they'll call me on their hologram phones

436
00:16:05,460 --> 00:16:07,800
然后说 "老爸救命 只能靠你了"
and say, "Help me, dad. You're my only hope."

437
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:10,200
我就会成为第7区最幸福的老爸
And I'll be the happiest father in Sector 7...

438
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:12,760
或者是第12区 如果我们混得很好的话
or Sector 12, if we're doing really well.

439
00:16:13,580 --> 00:16:15,100
搞不懂你妈怎么这么恼火
I don't know why your mom's so mad.

440
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:16,780
可能是因为
Maybe it has something to do

441
00:16:16,780 --> 00:16:18,680
你把宝贝儿子交给陌生人了
with giving your son away to a complete stranger.

442
00:16:18,940 --> 00:16:19,900
接下来就把你送出去
You're next.

443
00:16:19,900 --> 00:16:22,120
话说回来 你俩去商城干嘛
And what were you two doing in the mall, anyway?

444
00:16:22,260 --> 00:16:23,380
你俩不是去看《大白鲸》吗
I thought you were seeing "Moby Dick."

445
00:16:23,540 --> 00:16:24,440
票都卖完了
It was sold out.

446
00:16:24,780 --> 00:16:26,260
可能你能这样讨好她
Maybe that's how you can make it up to her--

447
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:27,960
明天替她带我去参加《白鲸记》阅读会
Take me to the "Moby dick" reading tomorrow.

448
00:16:28,020 --> 00:16:28,660
想得美
Nice try.

449
00:16:29,060 --> 00:16:30,760
无私地帮助她另一个儿子
Doing something selfless for her other son

450
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:32,380
能够弥补你这回犯下的滔天大罪
could make up for your monumental blunder.

451
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,820
送花和珠宝可能管用
Maybe flowers or jewelry.

452
00:16:33,940 --> 00:16:35,180
我喜欢用钱来解决问题
I like to throw money at the problem.

453
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:36,580
你好呀 美女
Hello, pretty lady.

454
00:16:36,580 --> 00:16:38,040
晚饭想吃什么啊
What do you wanna do for dinner?

455
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:40,540
不如用宝宝换一张披萨饼吧
How about we exchange the baby for a cheese pizza?

456
00:16:40,740 --> 00:16:42,660
-还在生气吗 -我打电话订票去
- Is this about today? - I'll call for those tickets.

457
00:16:43,540 --> 00:16:46,260
你本来应该和宝宝共度美好的亲子时光
You were supposed to spend quality time with the baby.

458
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,040
乔睡着了
Joe was asleep.

459
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:49,220
他根本不知道自己错过了木偶剧
He didn't even know he missed the puppet show.

460
00:16:49,420 --> 00:16:50,560
那叫"婴儿教学班"
It was the baby class!

461
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:51,400
好 你愿意怎么叫都行
Okay, call it what you want.

462
00:16:51,580 --> 00:16:53,100
我只看到一个嬉皮士手里拿着只青蛙
I saw a hippie with a frog on his hand.

463
00:16:53,100 --> 00:16:54,320
另外跟你说一声
And for your information,

464
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:56,480
我明天会带曼尼去那个朗读会
I'm takin' Manny to that reading tomorrow.

465
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:58,720
你现在只是在想办法给自己解围
Now you're just trying to dig yourself out of a hole

466
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:01,320
因为你知道自己的谎言被拆穿了
because you know that you were caught in a lie.

467
00:17:01,540 --> 00:17:02,960
-有件怪事 -等会儿再说 曼尼
- So here's something... - Not now, manny.

468
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:03,800
让他说
Oh, let him talk.

469
00:17:03,860 --> 00:17:04,640
我给剧场打了电话
I called the theater,

470
00:17:04,640 --> 00:17:06,420
他们说明天的演出还有很多票没卖出去
and they have tons of tickets for tomorrow's show.

471
00:17:06,860 --> 00:17:08,740
而且今天的演出门票也没有卖光
And it turns out today's show wasn't sold out, either.

472
00:17:08,740 --> 00:17:10,220
-曼尼 现在不是说这个的时候 -让他说
- Ay, Manny, not now. - Let him talk.

473
00:17:10,220 --> 00:17:11,480
妈 你为什么说票卖光了
Mom, why'd you say it was sold out?

474
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:12,780
是啊 你为什么说票卖光了
Yeah. Why'd you say it was sold out?

475
00:17:12,780 --> 00:17:16,100
我搞错了嘛 英语不是我的母语
It was a mistake. This is not my first language.

476
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:18,160
我不怎么懂英语滴
I don't understand English very goodly.

477
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,240
别打语言牌
Don't play that card.

478
00:17:19,329 --> 00:17:21,820
你跟我一样不想陪他去
You didn't wanna go any more than I did.

479
00:17:21,820 --> 00:17:24,920
好吧 我说了谎 但我有资格说谎
Fine. I lied, but I earned that lie.

480
00:17:25,113 --> 00:17:27,500
曼尼 我很抱歉
Ay, Manny, I am so sorry.

481
00:17:27,500 --> 00:17:30,000
但你知道我一直努力为这个家里每个人
But you know that I am always trying to do everything

482
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:32,020
尽心尽力 无微不至
for everybody in this family.

483
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,920
但你呢
But you.

484
00:17:34,520 --> 00:17:36,820
你只考虑你自己
You only do what's good for you.

485
00:17:36,885 --> 00:17:38,680
我告诉你吧 杰·普里契特
Let me tell you something, Jay Pritchett--

486
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:40,700
在抚养孩子这件事上
When it comes to raising kids,

487
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:44,260
种什么 得什么
you get what you give.

488
00:17:46,888 --> 00:17:48,641
你这英语倒是说得挺好的
Well, you rattled that off pretty goodly.

489
00:17:50,140 --> 00:17:51,960
你没必要这么做的 爸爸
You don't have to do this, daddy.

490
00:17:52,020 --> 00:17:53,920
我知道 但爸爸很想这么做 好吗
I know, but daddy really wants to do this, okay?

491
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:54,960
不不不
No, no, no.

492
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:56,133
不行 你想干什么 萨迪
No, what do you think you're doing, Sadie?

493
00:17:56,133 --> 00:17:57,700
不许插队 回去
No cutsies. Come on.

494
00:17:57,700 --> 00:17:58,140
下一个
Next.

495
00:17:58,980 --> 00:17:59,800
你好 麦洛
Hello, Milo.

496
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:01,620
你好 莉莉的爸爸之一
Hello, one of Lily's dads.

497
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:03,720
好 我们玩点刺激的吧 好吗
All right, let's make this interesting, okay?

498
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:06,260
如果我赢 就实行新规矩 好吗
If I win, the new rule is this, okay?

499
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:08,420
任何选手都不能连续玩三个回合以上
No player can play more than three times in a row

500
00:18:08,420 --> 00:18:09,720
一定要回去重新排队
without getting back in line

501
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:10,960
给其他孩子上场的机会
and letting the other kids play.

502
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:13,320
-要是我赢呢 -那我就给你两万块
- What if I win? - Then I'll give you $20,000.

503
00:18:13,500 --> 00:18:15,220
-来吧 -好 我们开始
- You're on. - All right. Let's do this.

504
00:18:19,700 --> 00:18:20,180
好耶
Yes!

505
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:21,980
我得一分
One point for me.

506
00:18:22,340 --> 00:18:23,700
我得一分 没错
One point for me. That's right.

507
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:26,700
麦洛 墙在这边呢
Milo, the wall's over here.

508
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:28,860
不行不行 这个不算 出界了
Nah, nah. Doesn't count. It was out.

509
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:31,340
太高了你够不着是吧
Little too high for you, huh?

510
00:18:31,525 --> 00:18:34,694
球弹三次墙壁 你个败寇
Three bounces to the wall, makes you a lo-ser,

511
00:18:34,694 --> 00:18:36,440
你个败寇
makes you a lo-ser.

512
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:39,920
最后一分 我得到就是我赢
Final point. I get this, I win.

513
00:18:40,261 --> 00:18:41,733
老天爷子保佑我
Oh, sweet lord jesus.

514
00:18:44,077 --> 00:18:47,113
好耶 好耶 我赢了
Whoo! Yes! Yes! Winner!

515
00:18:47,113 --> 00:18:49,176
冠军是我 我是冠军
cham-pi-on! Cham-pi-on!

516
00:18:49,236 --> 00:18:51,400
这阵子得让小卡负责接送莉莉了
Cam's gonna be doing drop-offs for a while.

517
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,760
我们收到了警告信
We got a letter.

518
00:18:54,580 --> 00:18:56,300
我相信你们都在琢磨
I'm sure you're both wondering

519
00:18:56,300 --> 00:18:57,980
我为什么今晚召集你们来这里
why I summoned you here tonight.

520
00:18:58,180 --> 00:19:01,040
现在我将呈上让人惊叹的"哇"元素
I now present to you the "Wow" factor.

521
00:19:02,428 --> 00:19:03,991
小卡
Cam...

522
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:08,760
我简直不敢相信你居然擅自做主了
I cannot believe that you went rogue.

523
00:19:09,100 --> 00:19:11,140
太不够意思了 我支持克莱尔
Uncool. I am with Claire on this.

524
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:12,840
你们很快就会明白原因
You'll soon see why.

525
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,660
准备好欣赏...
Prepare your senses...

526
00:19:14,660 --> 00:19:16,720
会跳舞的水吧
for dancing waters.

527
00:19:19,833 --> 00:19:21,160
-哇 -哇
- Wow. - Wow.

528
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:21,680
"哇"之元素
Factor.

529
00:19:22,251 --> 00:19:24,320
现在想象一个潜在买家
Now imagine a prospective buyer,

530
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:26,460
被这水芭蕾迷得神魂颠倒
so entranced by the aqua ballet,

531
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:29,900
于是当即决定花大价钱买下这房子
they're compelled instantly to make a rich offer.

532
00:19:30,100 --> 00:19:31,600
我甚至还在池子里装满了
I've even stocked the pools

533
00:19:31,600 --> 00:19:33,300
金子做的鱼
with fish of gold.

534
00:19:34,020 --> 00:19:35,120
其实就是金鱼
They're just goldfish,

535
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:36,749
但它们...它们就在这里
But they're-- they're right here.

536
00:19:39,285 --> 00:19:41,480
这...这真的很惊艳 小卡
This is... this is really impressive, Cam.

537
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:42,460
你花了多少钱
What did you spend?

538
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:44,460
实际上 没少花 但我不想说钱的事
Quite a bit, actually, but I don't wanna get into that.

539
00:19:44,460 --> 00:19:47,022
让我把功率提高到"十一十五"
Let me turn this up to eleventy-five.

540
00:19:50,355 --> 00:19:51,620
-哇 -哇
- Wow. - Wow.

541
00:19:51,620 --> 00:19:52,040
"哇"之元素
Factor.

542
00:19:53,820 --> 00:19:55,360
小卡 这些金鱼
Hey, Cam, are fish of gold

543
00:19:55,360 --> 00:19:57,120
这样倒着游正常吗
supposed to swim backwards like that?

544
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:58,653
不 据我所知 不正常
No, not to my knowledge, no.

545
00:19:58,860 --> 00:20:00,200
是哦 它们好像都...
Yeah, it's kind of like they're all--

546
00:20:00,210 --> 00:20:01,894
它们都在往那东西上聚集
They're gathering towards that thing.

547
00:20:01,894 --> 00:20:03,225
好像...天呐
It's like a-- oh, no!

548
00:20:03,225 --> 00:20:04,768
它们都被吸出来了
They are getting sucked out.

549
00:20:05,352 --> 00:20:06,784
你把小鱼们害死了
You're killing them!

550
00:20:07,329 --> 00:20:09,376
克莱尔 快把插销拔了
Claire! Unplug it!

551
00:20:09,376 --> 00:20:11,725
这是半截金鱼 半截金鱼啊
It's half a fish! That's a half a fish!

552
00:20:11,725 --> 00:20:13,540
在我们谓之生活的大染缸中
There are certain queer times and occasions

553
00:20:13,540 --> 00:20:15,800
总有些奇怪的时间和场合
in this strange, mixed affair we call life...

554
00:20:15,800 --> 00:20:17,900
当一个人把整个世界
When a man takes this whole universe

555
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:20,380
看作一个巨大的笑话
for a vast practical joke...

556
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:24,300
尽管那略显智慧 但他却并未察觉
Though the wit thereof he but dimly discerns...

557
00:20:24,300 --> 00:20:25,880
嘀嘀嘀 嘀嘀嘀嘀
Tick-tick-tick, tick-tick-tick-tick,

558
00:20:26,248 --> 00:20:27,371
看爷叱诧球场
Goes the dynamite,

559
00:20:27,928 --> 00:20:29,170
看爷笑傲江湖
goes the dynamite!

560
00:20:29,170 --> 00:20:30,880
他竟然毫不怀疑 那个笑话
And more than suspects that the joke

561
00:20:30,880 --> 00:20:34,400
其实嘲弄的是他自己 而非别人
is at nobody's expense but his own.

562
00:20:42,980 --> 00:20:45,020
-好 闭上眼睛 -为什么
- All right. Close your eyes. - Why?

563
00:20:45,139 --> 00:20:46,677
-相信我 -好吧
- Just trust me. - Okay.

564
00:20:48,420 --> 00:20:49,940
球场上永远不能闭眼
Never close your eyes on the court!

565
00:20:49,980 --> 00:20:51,760
-但你让我闭上 -不能让我影响到你
- But you told me... - Don't let me get in your head!

566
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:52,312
戳破它们
Pop 'em!

567
00:20:52,312 --> 00:20:54,511
在泡泡落地前戳破它们 快点
Pop 'em all before they hit the ground! Go!

568
00:20:55,381 --> 00:20:57,120
我不是很明白该怎么戳
I don't really understand how...

569
00:20:57,140 --> 00:20:58,900
握拳 把拇指放在边上
Make a fist with your thumb on the side.

570
00:20:59,380 --> 00:21:00,580
现在把拇指放到前面
Now bring your thumb to the front.

571
00:21:00,900 --> 00:21:01,780
好 再做一遍
Okay, now do it again.

572
00:21:02,860 --> 00:21:04,640
你刚刚用手语比了"屁股"
You just spelled "Ass" in sign language.

573
00:21:06,900 --> 00:21:08,220
好 闭上眼睛
Okay. Close your eyes.

574
00:21:08,700 --> 00:21:10,220
没事的 我们不在场上了
It's okay. We're off the court.

575
00:21:11,520 --> 00:21:12,960
你永远都在场上
You're never off the court!
